Recent research findings by researchers at the University of Turku can help to develop cancer treatments even more effective.
Findings carried out by Academy Professor Johanna Ivaska’s research group show that the hardness of a cancerous tumor increases the malignancies of cancer.
A number of human tissues, such as breast tissue, are very soft, and tissue cells grow in an ordinary way in such an environment.
